NG`, skipping nl/comment tokens like the C version, and pushes node-tree markers.\n\n9. **`compiler.rs`** — `compile_file` orchestrates `compile_process_create` → `lex_process_create` → `lex` → `parse`. Local helpers convert between this module's `Node`/`LexProcess` shapes and the dedicated module ones. Added small helper methods to `ClonableFile` (`new_writable`, `file_mut`, `path`) without altering the existing fields.\n\nThe project builds cleanly (warnings only — no errors), and a quick smoke test compiling `5467 abcd $` returns `COMPILER_FILE_COMPILED_OK`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":252,"cache_read_input_tokens":132763,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":252,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"74e8df6d-92d7-4f69-a23d-b11ec857478d","uuid":"f088006b-4bee-4017-851b-43e6d16043aa"}
